    <slider x="10" step="0.01" y="510" max="0.5" width="232" display="max-force" height="46" min="0.01" direction="Horizontal" default="0.1" variable="max-force"></slider>
    <switch x="10" y="562" height="40" on="true" variable="show-trails?" width="112" display="show-trails?"></switch>
    <switch x="130" y="562" height="40" on="true" variable="color-by-heading?" width="112" display="color-by-heading?"></switch>
    <view x="255" wrappingAllowedX="true" y="10" frameRate="30.0" minPycor="-35" height="501" showTickCounter="true" patchSize="7.0" fontSize="10" wrappingAllowedY="true" width="501" tickCounterLabel="ticks" maxPycor="35" updateMode="1" maxPxcor="35" minPxcor="-35"></view>
    <monitor x="255" precision="3" y="522" height="60" fontSize="11" width="120" display="Polarization (Phi)">global-polarization</monitor>
    <monitor x="382" precision="3" y="522" height="60" fontSize="11" width="120" display="Mean Speed">mean-speed</monitor>
    <monitor x="509" precision="2" y="522" height="60" fontSize="11" width="120" display="Mean NN Dist">mean-nn-dist</monitor>
    <monitor x="636" precision="2" y="522" height="60" fontSize="11" width="120" display="Mean Neighbors">mean-neighbors</monitor>
    <plot x="770" autoPlotX="true" yMax="1.05" autoPlotY="false" yAxis="Phi" y="10" xMin="0.0" height="280" legend="true" xMax="200.0" yMin="0.0" width="340" xAxis="ticks" display="Flock Polarization (Order Parameter)">
      <setup></setup>
      <update></update>
      <pen interval="1.0" mode="0" display="Polarization" color="-14253870" legend="true">
        <setup></setup>
        <update>plot global-polarization</update>
      </pen>
      <pen interval="1.0" mode="0" display="Mean Speed" color="-15096446" legend="true">
        <setup></setup>
        <update>plot mean-speed</update>
      </pen>
    </plot>
    <plot x="770" autoPlotX="true" yMax="12.0" autoPlotY="true" yAxis="value" y="302" xMin="0.0" height="280" legend="true" xMax="200.0" yMin="0.0" width="340" xAxis="ticks" display="Spatial Cohesion &amp; Separation">
      <setup></setup>
      <update></update>
      <pen interval="1.0" mode="0" display="Mean NN Dist" color="-2328546" legend="true">
        <setup></setup>
        <update>plot mean-nn-dist</update>
      </pen>
      <pen interval="1.0" mode="0" display="Mean Neighbors" color="-7256381" legend="true">
        <setup></setup>
        <update>plot mean-neighbors</update>
      </pen>
    </plot>
  </widgets>
  <info><![CDATA[## WHAT IS IT?

This model implements **Craig Reynolds' Boids algorithm** (1987, 1999) for emergent bird flocking and coordinated movement formation in 2D space.

## HOW IT WORKS

Each boid operates autonomously using only local perception (bounded by `perception-radius` and forward `fov-angle` cone) and combines three continuous steering forces via weighted vector superposition:

1. **Separation (Collision Avoidance)**: Inverse-distance weighted repulsion from neighbors inside `separation-radius`.
2. **Alignment (Velocity Matching)**: Steering force toward the average velocity vector of perceived flockmates.
3. **Cohesion (Flock Centering)**: Steering force toward the local center of mass of perceived flockmates.

Each behavior computes a Reynolds steering force `limit(normalize(desired) * max-speed - velocity, max-force)`, summed with weights (`separation-weight`, `alignment-weight`, `cohesion-weight`), capped by `max-force`, and integrated into `(vx, vy)` with speed clamped to `[min-speed, max-speed]`.
]]></info>
